Stabilize Google Gemini API integration within Local Study Notebook, implement dynamic model discovery (supporting current and future Google models from 1.5/2.0/2.5 to 3.5+), and ensure 100% tool-calling compatibility between the **Hermes Agent Workspace Tool Suite** and Google Gemini models.

