## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Hermes Agent Compatibility with Google Gemini Models**:  
> **YES, Google Gemini models work exceptionally well with the Hermes Agent!**  
> Modern Gemini models (`gemini-2.0-flash`, `gemini-1.5-pro`, `gemini-2.5-flash`) possess top-tier function-calling capabilities. When selected as the active model provider, Gemini can seamlessly execute all Hermes workspace tools (`search_vault`, `read_current_note`, `get_note_backlinks`, `create_summary_note`) to perform multi-note RAG and study synthesis.

> [!TIP]
> **Dynamic Model Discovery via Google API**:  
> When a user enters a Google API key, the app will dynamically query Google's `/v1beta/openai/models` endpoint to list all live, non-deprecated chat models available to that key. Users can select from the fetched list or manually enter any custom/preview model ID (e.g. `gemini-3.5-flash`).

> [!WARNING]
> **Safety Filter Interception**:  
> Gemini API returns HTTP 200 OK with empty text content when safety/recitation filters trigger (`finish_reason: "SAFETY"`). We will update the stream decoder to parse `finish_reason` and `promptFeedback` to give users clear safety notifications instead of silent empty message bubbles.

